3194139533977 true] [17592186275579 1089 "q-320394" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275579 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533977 true] [17592186275579 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13972686/assets/f63cf622acc15681e3815118bbd2a187ea6039a548d4be1773634c0dc450c343.png)\n\nDetermine the area $A$ of the parallelogram in the figure.\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275579 1113 #uuid "168c0e01-fa73-5720-9d05-467e30424e24" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275579 1145 "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨4,-1⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨-2,-3⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =4\\cdot (-3)-(-2)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =-12-2 \\\\  & =-14\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-14|=14\n$$" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275580 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275581 13194139533977 true] [17592186275580 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275582 13194139533977 true] [17592186275580 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533977 true] [17592186275580 1041 "field-1" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275580 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275582 13194139533977 true] [17592186275580 1110 #uuid "e8b93417-6775-5f38-8566-f0306993f132" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275581 1034 "10" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275581 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533977 true] [17592186275581 1111 #uuid "ddfe5f91-ee8a-5252-8be6-2a9828a470cf" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275582 1034 "14" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275582 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533977 true] [17592186275582 1111 #uuid "a7f3f431-4a20-536f-9053-222bd1fc38a2" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275583 1017 #edb/ref 17592186275584 13194139533977 true] [17592186275583 1089 "q-320550" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275583 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533977 true] [17592186275583 1100 "Given that the area spanned between the vectors $\\text{u}=⟨\\frac{3}{2},-5⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨a,6⟩$ equals zero, what is the value of $a?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275583 1113 #uuid "ac022c96-1345-5794-bcb4-16b0c470bf27" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275583 1145 "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & a \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & a \\\\ -5 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot 6-a\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =9+5a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9+5a & =0 \\\\ 5a & =-9 \\\\ a & =-\\frac{9}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275584 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275585 13194139533977 true] [17592186275584 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533977 true] [17592186275584 1041 "field-1" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275584 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275585 13194139533977 true] [17592186275584 1110 #uuid "8683ae6b-229d-55ef-a297-19782ce2469c" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275585 1034 "-\\frac{9}{5}" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275585 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533977 true] [17592186275585 1111 #uuid "fc11e97c-2e89-5dd7-89a6-1988b866f302" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275586 1017 #edb/ref 17592186275587 13194139533977 true] [17592186275586 1089 "q-69941" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275586 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533977 true] [17592186275586 1100 "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3} \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139533977 true] [17592186275586 1113 